🧪 Simulation and Verification

The Verilog testbench is used to verify the functionality of the sequence detector.

Test cases include:

- Input sequence 1011 – Detection HIGH
- Input sequence 1010 – No detection
- Input sequence 1101 – No detection
- Input sequence 1011011 – Multiple detections with overlap
- Reset operation – Returns FSM to initial state

📊 Expected Output

Input Sequence| Output
1011| 1
1010| 0
1101| 0
1011011| 1, 0, 0, 1 at the corresponding detection cycles

🎯 Applications

- Digital communication systems
